
               SYSTEM POLICY
               =============

  *  This system will not support or condone the copying of copyrighted
     materials, whether magnetic or otherwise. Those who abuse their
     MESSAGE BASE, DOWNLOADING or NETWORK privilages may have that
     privilage taken from them or be deleted altogether, at the
     discretion of the Sysop.

  *  No fees are charged, and there is no online time restriction (within
     reason).  Donations may be made and will not be refused.  We are
     planning on a faster modem so you might want to help us along!

  *  The caller is responsible for learning the proper use of this system
     through the online menu and help facilities and a basic knowledge of
     computers and telecommunictions is assumed.  We will help you as
     much as we can.  Remember, there are no such things as dumb questions.
     Everyone starts at square zero and has equal opportunity to learn.

  *  If you did not fill out a biography, please do so with a .ecb so others
     will be able to find out a little bit about you.
     You may see other user's biography with the .m username command.  Do
     a .m ? to see who has done one.

 %HOURS Operating hours
 %HELPOPT For all help options
